{"id":909962,"title":"06｜ReAct模式：零框架手写ReAct代码","content":"本节课程介绍了ReAct模式的理论与代码实践。ReAct模式通过精心设计的提示词，使大模型在不具备Function Calling能力的情况下也能调用工具扩展知识边界。其核心在于五个阶段：Thought、Action、Action Input、Pause和Observation。首先，用户向大模型提问，如“北京的天气怎么样”。大模型思考后返回Action（如get_weather）及Action Input（如city: 北京），并暂停等待。用户执行Action获取结果（如23度），将结果作为Observation传递给大模型。大模型根据Observation给出最终答案（如北京的天气是23度）。提示词模板包括循环结构和规则，确保大模型按预期运行。代码实践中，通过对比Function Calling，展示了ReAct模式的具体实现。使用通义千问的大模型，定义了提示词模板和工具列表，并通过死循环实现交互。示例中，大模型通过调用get_closing_price工具，比较青岛啤酒和贵州茅台的收盘价，最终返回结果。ReAct模式通过五个阶段循环，实现了类似Function Calling的功能。课后作业要求学生理解代码并自行设计工具进行实践。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":402601,"user_name":"行与修","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1241842,"ip_address":"江苏","ucode":"11F21B663EF6D3","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/f2/f2/2a9a6e9a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1758605392,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":146346,"content":"代码链接看一下课程介绍哈","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1943646,"ctime":1758703781,"ip_address":"山东","comment_id":402601,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101074901,"comment_content":"老师，代码示例github上有吗？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1943646,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1d/a8/5e/791d0f5e.jpg","nickname":"最后的风之子","note":"","ucode":"45D5487480A5D2","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":671931,"discussion_content":"代码链接看一下课程介绍哈","content_length":12,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1758703781,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"山东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":403122,"user_name":"Geek_53fa8c","can_de